        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SWP4741 Double Rocker Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPut the finishing touches on your home with a double rocker switch or outlet plate. It is available in 8 finishes including matte black, satin nickel and rubbed oil bronze. This solid brass double rocker switch cover is used with Decora style electrical outlets or switches and is made by Deltana to provide the perfect accent to your home or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4741.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"393\" height=\"343\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SWP4741 Double Switch Plate Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/single-rocker-solid-brass-plate-deltana-swp4754\"><b>Single Switch Plate</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/triple-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4740\"><b>Triple Switch Plate</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/quadruple-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4744\"><b>Quad Switch Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana SWP4741 Double Rocker Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing Width: 1-3/4\"center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4741-specifications.pdf?v=1704262299\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SWP4741 Double Rocker Cover Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
